# HOWTO — REQ-001 Local Execution

## Prerequisites

- Python 3.12
- Docker (for LocalStack and MinIO)
- pip

## 1. Install dependencies

```bash
cd runs/kit/REQ-001
pip install -r ci/requirements.txt
pip install ruff mypy
```

## 2. Set PYTHONPATH

```bash
export PYTHONPATH="$(pwd)/src:$PYTHONPATH"
```

## 3. Run unit tests (no external services needed)

```bash
python -m pytest test/shared/adapters/test_req_behavior.py -v -m "not integration" \
  --cov=src/shared/adapters --cov-report=term-missing
```

## 4. Start LocalStack (for aws profile integration tests)

```bash
docker run -d --name localstack -p 4566:4566 \
  -e SERVICES=s3,sqs,sns,ssm,logs \
  localstack/localstack:3
```

Wait ~10 seconds for startup, then:

```bash
DEPLOYMENT_PROFILE=aws \
AWS_ENDPOINT_URL=http://localhost:4566 \
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=test \
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=test \
python -m pytest test/shared/adapters/test_req_behavior.py -v -m integration -k "Aws or CrossProfile"
```

## 5. Start MinIO (for onprem profile integration tests)

```bash
docker run -d --name minio -p 9000:9000 -p 9001:9001 \
  -e MINIO_ROOT_USER=minioadmin \
  -e MINIO_ROOT_PASSWORD=minioadmin \
  minio/minio:latest server /data --console-address ":9001"
```

Wait ~5 seconds for startup, then:

```bash
DEPLOYMENT_PROFILE=onprem \
MINIO_ENDPOINT_URL=http://localhost:9000 \
MINIO_ACCESS_KEY=minioadmin \
MINIO_SECRET_KEY=minioadmin \
python -m pytest test/shared/adapters/test_req_behavior.py -v -m integration -k "Onprem or CrossProfile"
```

## 6. Run all tests together

```bash
# Start both LocalStack and MinIO first, then:
DEPLOYMENT_PROFILE=aws \
AWS_ENDPOINT_URL=http://localhost:4566 \
AWS_ACCESS_KEY_ID=test \
AWS_SECRET_ACCESS_KEY=test \
MINIO_ENDPOINT_URL=http://localhost:9000 \
MINIO_ACCESS_KEY=minioadmin \
MINIO_SECRET_KEY=minioadmin \
python -m pytest test/shared/adapters/test_req_behavior.py -v \
  --cov=src/shared/adapters --cov-report=term-missing
```

## 7. Lint and type check

```bash
ruff check src/ test/
ruff format --check src/ test/
mypy src/shared/adapters/ --strict --ignore-missing-imports
```

## 8. Cleanup

```bash
docker rm -f localstack minio
```

## Expected outputs

- Unit tests: all pass without external services
- Integration tests (aws): put/get/list/delete against LocalStack S3
- Integration tests (onprem): put/get/list/delete against MinIO
- Both profiles return adapters implementing identical port interfaces

